# Ear Clipping test: one concave U-shaped polygon, not pre-triangulated.
# Lies on the YZ plane; front normal is +X, opening points toward +Z.
# Expected result: 6 triangles, total area 7. The upper middle stays empty.
# Bounds: (0, -1.5, -1.5) to (0, 1.5, 1.5).
# White vertex colors; no external material or texture required.
